{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:46 2026-10-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:46 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:46 2026-10-15 HKT</p><p>元朗朗日路近元朗站外，今日（10月15日）傍晚6時許斜坡草叢突然起火。網上片段所見，現場火光熊熊，火舌險些燒及一個路邊電箱。消防接報趕至，迅速拖喉將火救熄，事件中無人受傷。目前起火原因仍在調查，初步懷疑為煙頭肇禍。</p><img alt=\"現場為元朗站外一處斜坡草叢。Threads：l._.aaa_i_22\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e02b9cc8d0bb2169866b571b65bdabf/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-15-20h23m02s358.png\"/><img alt=\"火勢一度威脅路邊一個電箱。Threads：zzz_lazy_bro\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97533ce469db2b09120117dbc1e700f9/2026-10/849146708_17952010626295416_8987995831064348903_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"火勢一度威脅路邊一個電箱。Threads：zzz_lazy_bro\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78ee5414d3b8f26de2d6047532dfcd7b/2026-10/849773015_17952010635295416_851044995878174957_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防趕至救熄。Threads：zzz_lazy_bro\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3ddda716a076e324b8ef28d73b8e0c4/2026-10/844838764_17952012237295416_8899422659489152019_n.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T13:00:38.832630+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:46:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:37:50.489365+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:57:39.348288+00:00","content_hash":"180bc7c435c9bbebbb75e07f3ac859474e16016565457ab0aa7f2f3ebba28ccb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}